IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPARQ-TOPK-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HEAD-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SNR-DB              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X100        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPARQ-TOPK-V2.
    IF NUM-HEADS == 0 OR HEAD-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 55 TO SNR-DB.
    MOVE 285 TO SPEEDUP-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-HEADS.
    WEIGHT 30 SPEEDUP-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
